  "description": "MUWLOH crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group I -4. Reported CIF formula moiety: C74 H104 Ho5 N8 O25 1+,14.5(H2 O1),Cl1 1-,2(C1 H1 Cl3). From the CIF bond table, Ho3 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho1 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ho2 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ho4 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ho5 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.486-3.631 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.72-99.34°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Ho5(LH)4(η1-Piv)(η2-Piv)3(μ2-η2η1-Piv)2(H2O)]Cl·14.5H2O·2CHCl3. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
